  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Development Facility PDF16ET01 STICHTING FLYING SWANS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide multi annual funding to the Stichting Flying Swans, who aims to develop agro logistical cool corridors in emerging markets. The funding will be used to identify and develop projects to become bankable projects in a number of identified countries. In the first scoping phase, Ethiopia and South Africa have been selected.</narrative>
  </description>
